esources, and navigate dangerous space . Too dangerous for you? Live a normal life on any planet, until consequences of peaceful life hit hard like a rock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305980/extras/7c4adeb7ae6d6bdb9526741c4c4fa4c6.poster.avif?t=1747339909\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305980/extras/7c4adeb7ae6d6bdb9526741c4c4fa4c6.webm?t=1747339909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305980/extras/7c4adeb7ae6d6bdb9526741c4c4fa4c6.mp4?t=1747339909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305980/extras/b06980f539777dc626bccb025a3fcf44.webp?t=1747339909\" data-has-big width=800 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0For more repetitive tasks utilize the Life Planner to  schedule your actions, optimizing your routines for maximum efficiency. Build enterprises, master skills, and grow your wealth on the planet until you are ready to conquer space. Every day is a step toward your ultimate goal, which, funny enough - you do not know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305980/extras/1020c936190153ce79aaa35ed4a19ab5.poster.avif?t=1747339909\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305980/extras/1020c936190153ce79aaa35ed4a19ab5.webm?t=1747339909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a